  "body": "### Purpose\n\nBased on the user request, this pull request internationalizes all user-visible text on the frontend using Paraglide, ensuring that the application supports multiple languages.\n\n### Code changes\n\n- **Internationalization Files**: Added comprehensive translations for the \"Publish Article\" page in both `en-us.json` and `zh-cn.json`. This includes titles, labels, placeholders, buttons, and status messages.\n- **Publish Page Component**: Modified the `publish/+page.svelte` file to replace all hardcoded text with calls to the Paraglide `msg` function. This makes the entire user interface for publishing an article fully multilingual.\n\n<!-- FUSION_KEEP_START -->\n<!-- FUSION_KEEP_END -->\n\n🔗 [Edit in Builder.io](https://builder.io/app/projects/623ab5eb98ad46cbad45f213ccd2d2f5/cosmos-zone)\n\n👀 [Preview Link](https://623ab5eb98ad46cbad45f213ccd2d2f5-cosmos-zone.projects.builder.my/)To clone this PR locally use the [Github CLI](https://cli.github.com/) with command `gh pr checkout 1`\n\n\n\n<!-- DO NOT EDIT THE CONTENT BELOW: -->\n<!--<projectId>623ab5eb98ad46cbad45f213ccd2d2f5</projectId>-->\n<!--<branchName>cosmos-zone</branchName>-->",
